---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/editorial.css';
---
<BaseLayout title="Design Partnerships" description="Explore a Hyphos pilot around one real workflow. Scope, access, success measures and pricing are discussed together before an engagement begins.">
<section class="product-editorial-hero page-shell"><p class="section-label">Design Partnerships</p><h1>One Workflow<br />A Useful Place<br />To Begin</h1><p>Hyphos is in design partnership. We're looking for work where the cost of losing context is clear, and a team willing to help shape a better way.</p><a href="/contact" class="button button--gold">Discuss A Pilot ↗</a></section>
<section class="pilot-steps page-shell"><article><span class="section-label">01 / Choose The Work</span><div><h2>Make The Problem Concrete</h2><p>A recurring handoff. A complex engagement. A process that depends on someone remembering the whole story.</p><p>Bring the workflow and the people who know it. We'll discuss whether Hyphos is a useful fit.</p></div></article><article><span class="section-label">02 / Define The Pilot</span><div><h2>Agree On What We're Testing</h2><p>Identify the sources, the people who need access and the result that would make the pilot worthwhile.</p><p>Scope, timing, data handling and pricing are discussed together before the engagement begins.</p></div></article><article><span class="section-label">03 / Learn From The Work</span><div><h2>Review What Actually Changes</h2><p>Can the team retrieve the right context? Can someone check the answer? Does the next handoff start from a better place?</p><p>Use the experience to decide what should continue, change or stop.</p></div></article></section>
<section class="product-editorial-closing page-shell"><span class="section-label">Let's Find Out</span><h2>What Does Your Team<br />Keep Having To Rediscover?</h2><p>Tell us about the work. No prepared brief or platform commitment needed to start the conversation.</p><a href="/contact" class="button button--gold">Talk With Us ↗</a></section>
</BaseLayout>
